# An old broad park tree, three tiles of canopy over a two tile trunk. The
# heaviest thing in the woods: nine lobes of canopy, a thick bark trunk with
# roots, and a wide soft shadow. Same autumn and dark variants as park-tree.
sprite park-tree-large
size 48 64
layer object
footprint 2 1
origin 8 48
tag tree plant park
variant autumn v=y V=Y !=9 J=8
variant dark v=V V=! !=J J=7

frame default
